\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017072219\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.745 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 272/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2397/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 168/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6313/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.940      1 Template:AHSME_30p_box\n100.00%   11.940      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16705:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017072219 and revision id 118186. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}